## Interface: 16001, 11509
## Title: Forever Told
## Notes: Your story, forever told. A journal of your journey to 60: first visits, level-ups, bosses, quests, loot, friends, deeds and chapter recaps, plus grudges, wanted posters, a guild bounty board for sweet revenge and a guild chronicle of everyone's big moments. Type /told or click the book on your minimap.
